<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 21px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;">We would like to extend an exclusive invitation to you for an evening dedicated to "<a style="color: #223341;" href="https://more.flywire.com/FlywireHosted_EDU_AgentFlywireConnectDelhi_August2023_2.RegistrationPage.html?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>Accelerating Innovation and Success across the Global Education EcoSystem.</u></strong></span></a>" Join us on Saturday, 19 August, 2023 at 6:30 PM and prepare to be inspired by education industry-leading experts as we delve into the future of international education and the transformative power of collaboration.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;"><span style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 21px;"><strong>Flywire Connect Delhi</strong> is a highly anticipated event bringing together professionals, thought leaders, and influencers from the global education ecosystem.</span></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">We are proud to announce that our confirmed keynote speakers include:</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li style="text-align: left;">Mina Fakhouri, Vice President APAC EDU &amp; Global Agents, Flywire</li> 
<li style="text-align: left;">Aatreyee Guha Thakurta, Assistant Director of Education, India, British Council</li> 
<li style="text-align: left;">Vivek Mansukhanim, Head of International Education India (IIE India), IIE India</li> 
<li style="text-align: left;">Austrade (Speaker to be confirmed)&nbsp;</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">Attending Flywire Connect Delhi will grant you exclusive access to invaluable information encompassing the forefront of industry trends, profound insights, and unparalleled best practices.</p> <p style="margin: 0px; text-align: left;">‌<br /></p> </td> 
